   :why      "2026-08-20: cloud-itonami cut a did:webvh genesis and it is on main, but
              https://itonami.cloud/.well-known/did.jsonl is 404. Cloudflare Pages for
              this project has no git provider, so main advancing deploys nothing, and
              the deploy is currently refused by deploy-local-root-pin-guard because four
              :local/root dependencies hold other sessions uncommitted work. Until it is
